tice that there are $16$ ounces in each pound.  \n\nSince the price is $$0.75$ per ounce, to find the price per pound, we multiply by $16:$\n\n$$\n0.75\\times 16=12\n$$\n\nTherefore, the almonds cost $$12$ per pound." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-14b9646b-84f3-5527-a013-f8974a97792e"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-14b9646b-84f3-5527-a013-f8974a97792e" :answer-field/id #uuid "14b9646b-84f3-5527-a013-f8974a97792e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-e3429c35-cffd-5c1d-a927-f2b3fb6ffd84" :answer-field/choices ["answer-89a61866-108b-5d5c-a9c6-f994eea7b3b6" "answer-e3429c35-cffd-5c1d-a927-f2b3fb6ffd84" "answer-3cc156c5-da42-5cf1-afb4-e1a9ccffe353" "answer-b2b7ba53-17b8-5b02-a5ce-b70700a2a8f9" "answer-b3bd2153-3094-504a-9e6a-b74cf2b19e82"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-89a61866-108b-5d5c-a9c6-f994eea7b3b6" :answer/id #uuid "89a61866-108b-5d5c-a9c6-f994eea7b3b6" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$$10$ per pound" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e3429c35-cffd-5c1d-a927-f2b3fb6ffd84" :answer/id #uuid "e3429c35-cffd-5c1d-a927-f2b3fb6ffd84" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$$12$ per pound" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3cc156c5-da42-5cf1-afb4-e1a9ccffe353" :answer/id #uuid "3cc156c5-da42-5cf1-afb4-e1a9ccffe353" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$$14$ per pound" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b2b7ba53-17b8-5b02-a5ce-b70700a2a8f9" :answer/id #uuid "b2b7ba53-17b8-5b02-a5ce-b70700a2a8f9" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$$16$ per pound" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b3bd2153-3094-504a-9e6a-b74cf2b19e82" :answer/id #uuid "b3bd2153-3094-504a-9e6a-b74cf2b19e82" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$$20$ per pound" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "activity-3d177d8b-58a3-5a2a-b0d6-cb5cc61